      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "pf",
        "label": {
          "en": "◆ Why It Works — First-Principles Derivation (Unit 1B · Rational Functions, End Behavior, Asymptotes & Binomial Theorem)",
          "ar": "◆ البرهان والاشتقاق الرياضي (الوحدة 1B · الدوال النسبية وسلوك الأطراف وخطوط التقارب ونظرية ذات الحدين)"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p><strong>First-Principles Justification:</strong> Completing the square on \\( ax^2 + bx + c \\) gives \\( a\\!\\left(x + \\frac{b}{2a}\\right)^2 + \\left(c - \\frac{b^2}{4a}\\right) \\), which simultaneously establishes the vertex coordinates, discriminant condition \\( \\Delta = b^2 - 4ac \\), and quadratic root formula.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1B.A — Foundational Formulation",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 1B.A — تطبيق أساسي"
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Express \\( f(x) = x^2 - 6x + 11 \\) in completed-square vertex form and find its minimum value.",
          "ar": "أوجد صيغة إكمال المربع للدالة \\(f(x) = x^2 - 6x + 11\\)."
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Halving \\( -6 \\) gives \\( -3 \\), so \\( f(x) = (x - 3)^2 - 9 + 11 = (x - 3)^2 + 2 \\). Minimum value is \\( 2 \\) at \\( x = 3 \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1B.B — Multi-Step Tangency & Discriminant",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 1B.B — شرط التماس والمميز"
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Find the value of \\( k \\) for which \\( y = 2x + k \\) is tangent to \\( y = x^2 - 6x + 14 \\).",
          "ar": "أوجد قيمة \\(k\\) التي تجعل المستقيم \\(y = 2x + k\\) مماساً للمنحنى \\(y = x^2 - 6x + 14\\)."
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>Equating gives \\( x^2 - 8x + (14 - k) = 0 \\). Setting \\( \\Delta = (-8)^2 - 4(14 - k) = 0 \\) yields \\( k = -2 \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1B.C — Rate of Change & Tangent Slope",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 1B.C — معدل التغير وميل المماس"
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Find the instantaneous rate of change of \\( g(x) = x^3 - 9x^2 + 27x + 2 \\) at \\( x = 5 \\).",
          "ar": "أوجد معدل التغير اللحظي للدالة \\(g(x) = x^3 - 9x^2 + 27x + 2\\) عند \\(x = 5\\)."
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\( g'(x) = 3(x - 3)^2 \\), so \\( g'(5) = 3(2)^2 = 12 \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "workedExampleCard",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked Example 1B.D — Synthesis & Definite Accumulation",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 1B.D — مسألة شاملة"
        },
        "problem": {
          "en": "Evaluate \\( \\int_0^2 (3x^2 + 6x + 2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x \\).",
          "ar": "احسب \\(\\int_0^2 (3x^2 + 6x + 2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\)."
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "<p>\\( \\left[x^3 + 3x^2 + 2x\\right]_0^2 = 8 + 12 + 4 = 24 \\).</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
